  "prefLabel": "Rev 1701.17 Program",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1701.17 “Program” means activities, operations, or organizational units directed to attaining specific purposes or objectives.\n\nSource. #4940, eff 9-25-90; ss by #6335, eff 9-24-96; ss by #8179, eff 9-24-04; ss by #10214, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13489, eff 11-15-22 (formerly Rev 1701.11) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1700)",
